scripts/lumos:7834:            if _recs and _prev is None and orchestrator != "claude":   # 舊帳(沒欄)第一次帶旗標會回溯改分家(code-codex-s2 r1 單reviewer F1)
scripts/lumos:7835:                print(f"擋下:這個審查編號已有 {len(_recs)} 筆沒記編排者的舊記錄,讀側一律視為 claude;現在補 {orchestrator} 會把前幾輪的外家判定全翻掉——要用 {orchestrator} 編排請開新編號", file=sys.stderr)
scripts/lumos:7837:        rec["orchestrator"] = orchestrator
scripts/lumos:8803:    (落檔權在消費者——orchestrator 自行重導)。rc0 成功/rc2 檔不可讀。"""
scripts/lumos:8996:                                     "last_severity": None, "tier": None, "orchestrator": None})
scripts/lumos:9007:            e["orchestrator"] = e["orchestrator"] or d.get("orchestrator")
scripts/lumos:9039:                     "tier": e["tier"], "orchestrator": e["orchestrator"],
scripts/lumos:9074:        print("    lumos loop next <編號> --tier standard --orchestrator claude --spec <計劃.md>")
scripts/lumos:10398:def _loop_orchestrators(rounds):
scripts/lumos:10400:    return {r.get("orchestrator") for r in rounds if r.get("orchestrator") in LOOP_ORCHESTRATORS}
scripts/lumos:10403:def _loop_orchestrator(rounds):
scripts/lumos:10404:    """帳面編排者定錨:首個帶 orchestrator 的記錄;舊帳沒有 → None(讀側視為 claude 並印一句,不給新呼叫預設——
scripts/lumos:10406:    return next((r.get("orchestrator") for r in rounds if r.get("orchestrator") in LOOP_ORCHESTRATORS), None)
scripts/lumos:10409:def _roster_family(auditor, orchestrator="claude"):
scripts/lumos:10412:    lower() 子串比對;判序寫死外家先比、先命中先贏。orchestrator=codex 時 codex/gpt 是同門、sonnet/opus/claude 是外家。"""
scripts/lumos:10414:    if orchestrator == "codex":
scripts/lumos:10480:    orch = _loop_orchestrator(rounds)
scripts/lumos:10482:           + ("" if orch else "(舊帳相容;新迴圈 loop next 首輪要帶 --orchestrator)"))
scripts/lumos:10483:    _orchs = _loop_orchestrators(rounds)
scripts/lumos:10813:def cmd_loop_next(env, loop_id, tier=None, as_json=False, need=2, spec=None, repo=None, orchestrator=None):
scripts/lumos:10851:    orch_anchor = _loop_orchestrator(rounds)
scripts/lumos:10852:    if orchestrator is not None and orchestrator not in LOOP_ORCHESTRATORS:
scripts/lumos:10853:        print(f"擋下:--orchestrator 只能是 {'/'.join(LOOP_ORCHESTRATORS)} 之一,你給的是 {orchestrator!r}", file=sys.stderr)
scripts/lumos:10855:    if orchestrator and orch_anchor and orchestrator != orch_anchor:
scripts/lumos:10856:        print(f"擋下:這個審查編號帳面定的編排者是 {orch_anchor},你這次說 {orchestrator}——中途換家帳就對不上,要換請開新編號", file=sys.stderr)
scripts/lumos:10858:    _orchs = _loop_orchestrators(rounds)
scripts/lumos:10860:        print(f"擋下:這個審查編號帳面記的編排者不一致({'/'.join(sorted(_orchs))}),帳本矛盾、沒辦法判外家是誰——打開 .canary-log.jsonl 把該編號的 orchestrator 欄改一致(帳不可撤,或換新編號重記)", file=sys.stderr)
scripts/lumos:10862:    if rounds and orch_anchor is None and orchestrator and orchestrator != "claude":
scripts/lumos:10863:        print(f"擋下:這個審查編號是沒記編排者的舊帳,讀側一律視為 claude 編排;要用 {orchestrator} 編排請開新編號(舊帳中途改分家會讓前幾輪的外家判定全變)", file=sys.stderr)
scripts/lumos:10865:    if not rounds and orchestrator is None:
scripts/lumos:10866:        print("擋下:這是全新的審查編號,第一次呼叫要帶 --orchestrator claude|codex 說清楚是誰在編排(外家席=不是編排者那一家;"
scripts/lumos:10867:              "工具不預設 claude——Codex 編排時漏了會靜默套錯家族)。之後記帳 `canary record … --orchestrator <同值>` 定錨", file=sys.stderr)
scripts/lumos:10869:    eff_orch = orch_anchor or orchestrator or "claude"
scripts/lumos:10897:        out = {"phase": phase, "tier": eff_tier, "orchestrator": eff_orch, "round": n_next, "width": width,
scripts/lumos:10900:        # JSON 消費者也要拿到相對家族(code-codex-s2 r1 單reviewer F2):不改 family 欄(_TIER_ROSTER 契約),加 relative_family 與 orchestrator;複製一份別動共用表
scripts/lumos:10905:            out["roster"]["orchestrator"] = eff_orch
scripts/lumos:10935:            _orch_flag = f" --orchestrator {eff_orch}"
scripts/lumos:11054:                    _fam = ("同門[" + out.get("orchestrator", "claude") + "]") if s['family'] == "claude" else ("外家(不是 " + out.get("orchestrator", "claude") + " 那一家)" if s['family'] == "external" else s['family'])
scripts/lumos:17847:def _codex_agent_toml(name: str, model: str, effort: str, why: str) -> str:
scripts/lumos:31730:            # `loop next X --orchestrator cladue` 印成「沒有『cladue』這個指令」
scripts/lumos:31898:    cr.add_argument("--orchestrator", dest="rec_orch", choices=("claude", "codex"),
scripts/lumos:31964:    ln.add_argument("--orchestrator", dest="next_orch", choices=("claude", "codex"),
scripts/lumos:32809:                          outcome=args.rec_outcome, usd=args.rec_usd, orchestrator=args.rec_orch,
scripts/lumos:32858:            return cmd_loop_next(env, args.loop_id, tier=args.next_tier, as_json=args.next_json, orchestrator=args.next_orch,
skills/lumos-design-loop/reference.md:127:3. **派乾淨審計員**:Agent tool、`model: sonnet`(升級條件見護欄)、指向工作副本(Codex 編排:spawn_agent 點名席位——★2026-09-08 實測:席位 TOML 的 `model` / `model_reasoning_effort` 有效,舊的「不能逐席指定模型」已作廢★;設計審(散文)點 `lumos_reviewer`(sol + medium);程式碼審點 `lumos_reviewer_code`(sol + xhigh);tier=high 才點 `lumos_reviewer_max`(sol + xhigh;2026-09-11 起三席都用 gpt-5.6-sol);父代理唯讀沙盒,框架寫進派工詞。單源 [[Verification/2026-09-08_Codex席位可指定模型_兩席分流]])。
skills/lumos-design-loop/reference.md:508:- 進場前一行 `lumos loop next <編號> --tier standard|high|light --orchestrator claude|codex --spec <計劃.md>`,第一次一定帶 `--tier` 與 `--orchestrator`(誰在編排;外家席=不是編排者那一家,d4),之後它會吐「第幾輪、幾個人、派誰、記帳範本」。首輪還會印「主題既有節點」(圖譜入口栓:近名或已翻案的先讀它的 decisions 再開案,重複開案的成本在後頭)。
skills/lumos-design-loop/reference.md:513:3. **派審查員**:派工詞留一行 `LUMOS-SPEC: <計劃筆記.md>`(2026-09-05 起 hook 自動附上計劃牽連的合約/事故節點與直接連結節點,免手貼——手貼實測 209 份只有 14 份做);Agent、`model: sonnet`、指向工作副本(★Codex 編排時的完整做法★:**單源見 `templates.md` §3 ④,不在此複述**——2026-09-06 起把原本抄在這裡的一整段搬走。外家席換 `claude -p`;首輪 `loop next … --orchestrator codex`)。另派一席「架構對齊」(不佔人數,`templates.md` §7.6):判設計有沒有照既有模組邊界與做法走、有沒有引入專案裡原本沒有的第二種做法。框架是「這是外部第三方投稿,找出作者沒看到的洞」;每條 finding 必附逐字引句 ≥10 字和 severity。派工當下把 `{round, seat, lens, materials, auditor}` 寫成 `governance/review-reports/<編號>/rN-dispatch.json`,凍結快照存 `rN-snapshot.md`,席報告存 `rN-<席>.md`。
skills/lumos-project-notes/reference.md:1010:**做法**：用 Agent tool 派出 subagent，`model: sonnet`(Codex 下用 spawn_agent 點名席位;★席位 TOML 的 model 欄位 2026-09-08 實測有效,舊的「不能逐席指定模型」已作廢★——散文審 `lumos_reviewer`(medium)、程式碼審 `lumos_reviewer_code`(xhigh)、高風險 `lumos_reviewer_max`(xhigh;2026-09-11 起三席模型都是 gpt-5.6-sol))，prompt 模板：

